{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voxel Eras</strong> is a first-person factory builder about progressing through eras of technology. You'll gather resources, process them into more products, build new machines in progressively advancing technological eras, and combining them into production lines to <strong>let the machines do the work</strong> for you in your ever growing workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build with friends in <strong>Multiplayer CO-OP</strong> (or by yourself in<strong> Singleplayer </strong>if you're more into that) in the game's fully modifiable <strong>Voxel</strong> world, working to face the ever growing complexities of technology as you work your way through the Eras. If you're wanting something fresh you can also try <strong>Modding,</strong> where scripting allows you to create your own tailored experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you conquer the Eras?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3192010?t=1760788689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3192010?t=1760788689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192010/f109acff6f5e141dd96bc671b6f0cb512c6b6094/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760788689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192010/f109acff6f5e141dd96bc671b6f0cb512c6b6094/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760788689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voxel Eras</strong> is a first-person factory builder about progressing through eras of technology. You'll gather resources, process them into more products, build new machines in progressively advancing technological eras, and combining them into production lines to <strong>let the machines do the work</strong> for you in your ever growing workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build with friends in <strong>Multiplayer CO-OP</strong> (or by yourself in<strong> Singleplayer </strong>if you're more into that) in the game's fully modifiable <strong>Voxel</strong> world, working to face the ever growing complexities of technology as you work your way through the Eras. If you're wanting something fresh you can also try <strong>Modding,</strong> where scripting allows you to create your own tailored experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you conquer the Eras?</strong></p>","developers":["Destiny Hailstorm"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192010/ba0b1d1f2f72e616415cf7b621b10267e1142c10/header.jpg?t=1760788689","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2022-2025 Destiny Hailstorm, All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Standard Linux Distro - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Modern Quad Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><st